# Hot, with a feels-like pushed in over MQTT. Covers the full-strength amber, which
# default.scn cannot: default deliberately carries no feels_like line, so it exercises
# the locally computed fallback and its muted colour instead. Between the two you can
# see at a glance whether the provenance colours are actually distinguishable.
time         2026-08-07 19:42:00
temp         88.5
humidity     61
feels_like   97
sensor_dead  false
trains       4 12 19 27
bluetrains   2 9 16 24
event        Beach trip
event_days   12
flight       AA123
flight_dest  MI
weather      fixtures/open-meteo-summer.json
